{"id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-CT.md","title":"组合真理理论CT","display":"df-CT — 组合真理理论CT","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-CT","aliases":["91-df-CT","91-df-compositional-truth-CT","91-df-CT-theory"],"display":"df-CT — 组合真理理论CT","depends_on":["[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","[[91-df-compositional-truth]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-CT"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-CT</span><span>91-df-compositional-truth-CT</span><span>91-df-CT-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-CT — 组合真理理论CT"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66b3ab8406681395\" href=\"?note=66b3ab8406681395\" title=\"91-df-compositional-truth\">91-df-compositional-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-CT-—-组合真理理论CT-$\\mathrm{CT}$\">df-CT — 组合真理理论CT <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (带真理谓词的语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> (不含扩展语言归纳的组合真理理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"66b3ab8406681395\" href=\"?note=66b3ab8406681395\" title=\"91-df-compositional-truth\">91-df-compositional-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\\)</span> (扩展语言的完全归纳模式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> (经典一阶逻辑的演绎闭包)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}CT}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CT}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}CT}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CT}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span> : 组合真理理论 (Compositional Truth)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}\\)</span> : 组合公理集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\)</span> : 带真理谓词的完全归纳</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CT 的定义：\n本文件明确把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span> 定义为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}+\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}+\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>。上标减号的理论只含 PA\n原有的算术归纳；无上标的 CT 还允许对含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的公式归纳。</p>\n<p>CT与其他类型化理论的比较：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>组合公理</th>\n<th>归纳模式</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>TB</td>\n<td>T-schema（句子）</td>\n<td>仅基础语言 PA 归纳</td>\n<td>对 PA 算术保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTB</td>\n<td>统一 T-schema（公式）</td>\n<td>仅基础语言 PA 归纳</td>\n<td>对 PA 算术保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TB+</td>\n<td>T-schema（句子）</td>\n<td>本目录定义为完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 归纳</td>\n<td>算术状态须单独证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTB+</td>\n<td>统一 T-schema（公式）</td>\n<td>本目录定义为完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 归纳</td>\n<td>非算术保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span></td>\n<td>完全组合</td>\n<td>仅 PA 归纳</td>\n<td>算术保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span></td>\n<td>完全组合</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 完全归纳</td>\n<td>非算术保守</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>CT 的关键定理应按元层模式陈述：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CT}\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CT}\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>即 CT 对每个基础语言句子恢复相应 T-schema 实例；这里没有在对象语言\n中量化公式变量。</p>\n<p>CT 与保守性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Kotlarski–Krajewski–Lachlan 保守性定理适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span> 含扩展语言完全归纳，能形式化 PA 证明的\n组合声性并推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>，所以不是 PA 的算术保守扩张。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CT的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>区分“组合公理的强度”与“扩展语言归纳的强度”</li>\n<li>完全捕获真理的组合性质</li>\n<li>为无类型理论提供参照基准</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-CT-—-组合真理理论CT-$\\mathrm{CT}$","text":"df-CT — 组合真理理论CT $\\mathrm{CT}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-compositional-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-compositional-truth","status":"resolved","id":"66b3ab8406681395","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-compositional-truth","status":"resolved","id":"66b3ab8406681395","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$ (不含扩展语言归纳的组合真理理论, see [[91-df-compositional-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}$ (扩展语言的完全归纳模式, see [[91-df-induction-schema]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}CT}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CT}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}+\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CT}\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":2719,"backlinks":[{"id":"66b3ab8406681395","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"标准的 $\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$ 对 PA 算术保守。它在扩展语言中比 TB\n拥有更多统一的真理定理，但这不意味着有更多纯算术定理。\n含完整 $\\mathcal L_T$ 归纳的 $\\mathrm{CT}$ 由 [[91-df-CT]] 另行定义，\n且不是 PA 的算术保守扩张。故必须同时标明是否有上标 “$-$” 和采用哪种\n归纳；本节点只引入 $\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$，不重复定义完整 CT。"},{"id":"d0dc2670ffdd2806","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f32c7d95792dcee2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunctio